WEBVTT

00:30.310 --> 00:31.390
Good morning.

00:41.610 --> 00:45.070
Let's give it our best today as well!

00:45.900 --> 00:47.820
(Ifuru Counter)
The Guild Receptionist

00:48.070 --> 00:49.120
(Ifuru Counter)
is a desk job,

00:49.200 --> 00:50.660
so it's completely secure.

00:50.740 --> 00:53.330
As a civil servant,
it's stable and secure.

00:53.410 --> 00:55.710
As long as I wear the cute uniform,

00:55.790 --> 00:58.250
guide adventurers with a smile,

00:58.580 --> 01:00.670
and complete my admin work leisurely,

01:00.750 --> 01:02.630
I can clock out on time.

01:02.710 --> 01:04.880
It's the job I've always dreamed of.

01:05.590 --> 01:08.300
Well then, have a safe adventure.

01:09.050 --> 01:11.050
Well, that's how it should be.

01:16.940 --> 01:19.810
It's all because
you haven't been defeated.

01:21.980 --> 01:23.610
My overtime hell

01:25.150 --> 01:27.280
never ends!

01:27.360 --> 01:30.620
You bastard!

01:35.540 --> 01:41.420
(I May Be a Guild Receptionist,
but I'll Solo Any Boss to Clock Out on Time)

03:03.710 --> 03:05.210
Next, please.

03:06.170 --> 03:07.840
Next, please.

03:08.710 --> 03:10.510
It's finally my turn.

03:11.010 --> 03:13.970
Hey, isn't that Guns, the Savage Blade?

03:14.050 --> 03:16.560
Wow, he's one of the guild's elites!

03:18.180 --> 03:19.850
No, stop dragging your feet.

03:19.930 --> 03:21.640
Hurry up and get over here!

03:22.770 --> 03:24.310
Welcome.

03:24.400 --> 03:26.940
I'm here to subdue the floor boss
of the Belfra Underground Ruins,

03:27.020 --> 03:29.490
Hell-Flame Dragon.

03:29.570 --> 03:30.570
Someone's finally doing it?

03:30.780 --> 03:31.610
Seriously?

03:31.700 --> 03:33.110
Let me confirm it for you.

03:33.200 --> 03:34.910
Is our quest coming to an end?

03:35.280 --> 03:38.790
Looks like everyone's eager
to see us in action.

03:39.580 --> 03:41.750
This dungeon's taking forever to clear.

03:42.160 --> 03:44.330
It's only natural that you'd turn to us,

03:44.420 --> 03:45.880
the Silver Sword.

03:46.590 --> 03:48.630
You're taking forever to clear this!

03:49.920 --> 03:50.760
This time,

03:50.840 --> 03:52.590
since you're participating with a party,

03:52.670 --> 03:55.090
please show me your second-class license.

03:55.180 --> 03:56.680
I'm a member of Silver Sword,

03:56.760 --> 03:58.970
the strongest party in the Guild.

03:59.060 --> 04:00.430
Since you're the receptionist,

04:00.520 --> 04:03.140
I'm sure you'd know my class
without having to check my license.

04:03.940 --> 04:05.690
Of course, I do!

04:05.770 --> 04:07.940
I serve adventurers like you every day.

04:08.020 --> 04:09.110
I'll remember it even if I don't want to.

04:09.190 --> 04:14.200
But you can't take on a quest
without a license.

04:14.610 --> 04:16.320
Of course, I know your class.

04:16.740 --> 04:19.280
But to prevent adventurers
from risking their lives,

04:19.370 --> 04:21.910
checking if the adventurer's class
matches the dungeon's difficulty level

04:22.000 --> 04:24.210
is also the job of the receptionist.

04:24.290 --> 04:25.370
I see.

04:25.460 --> 04:28.170
In that case, will this do?

04:28.250 --> 04:30.210
Please present your license.

04:31.260 --> 04:34.680
- I'm the Silver Sword...
- Please present your license.

04:34.800 --> 04:37.640
- The Savage Blade Guns…
- Please present your license.

04:38.930 --> 04:40.260
I guess it can't be helped.

04:40.930 --> 04:42.930
Thank you for showing your license.

04:43.020 --> 04:45.310
Well then, have a safe adventure.

04:47.060 --> 04:49.400
The queue is ridiculously long.

04:49.730 --> 04:52.230
There's no end in sight.

04:52.740 --> 04:53.570
No, no!

04:53.650 --> 04:54.820
Come on, you got this!

04:55.150 --> 04:56.490
Thank you for waiting.

04:56.570 --> 04:57.700
Next, please.

04:57.780 --> 04:59.530
(Metropolis, Ifuru)

04:59.620 --> 05:01.740
In the past,
the ancestors of this continent,

05:01.830 --> 05:03.500
Helicasia, were known as Dia.

05:03.580 --> 05:04.500
Rumor has it

05:04.580 --> 05:06.330
that they were blessed by the gods

05:06.420 --> 05:08.580
and established
an extremely advanced civilization.

05:09.460 --> 05:10.840
However, one day,

05:10.920 --> 05:12.840
they suddenly disappeared.

05:13.420 --> 05:16.260
Monsters took over
the entire continent in their place,

05:16.340 --> 05:18.180
making it a deadly territory.

05:19.390 --> 05:20.680
Then, 200 years ago,

05:20.760 --> 05:23.020
a group of people came to this continent,
infiltrated the dungeon,

05:23.100 --> 05:24.390
fought monsters,

05:24.480 --> 05:26.810
and rebuilt human towns.

05:26.890 --> 05:29.100
They were adventurers.

05:29.900 --> 05:32.940
Among the reception halls
of the Adventurer's Guild,

05:33.030 --> 05:34.690
Ifuru Counter

05:34.780 --> 05:36.820
boasts the largest scale.

05:40.820 --> 05:42.530
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

05:42.620 --> 05:43.620
How was the Belfra Underground Ruins?

05:43.700 --> 05:45.620
That dungeon was insane!

05:45.700 --> 05:48.370
- I heard the boss is incredibly strong.
- Can someone really beat it?

05:48.710 --> 05:51.960
I'm halfway through
processing the request form.

05:52.040 --> 05:54.710
Next, I need to tally up the number
of quests we received today

05:54.800 --> 05:56.550
and organize the reports.

05:56.630 --> 05:58.840
And then…

05:59.590 --> 06:01.100
I want to go home.

06:01.600 --> 06:03.560
I'm supposed to be living…

06:08.100 --> 06:09.940
a stable...

06:10.440 --> 06:12.310
and orderly...

06:12.400 --> 06:14.320
life right now.

06:16.610 --> 06:18.570
It's not orderly at all.

06:19.570 --> 06:21.780
I'll just do it tomorrow.

06:23.700 --> 06:24.620
No, no!

06:24.700 --> 06:27.120
If I put it off until later,
it'll just pile up.

06:27.200 --> 06:29.040
I have to clock out on time tomorrow

06:29.120 --> 06:30.830
and enjoy my life peacefully!

06:32.250 --> 06:33.250
All right!

06:41.590 --> 06:43.300
Okay, let's get to work!

06:44.640 --> 06:46.180
The reason I have endless work

06:46.520 --> 06:48.230
is because of the boss
of the Belfra Underground Ruins,

06:48.310 --> 06:50.140
the Hell-Flame Dragon.

06:50.600 --> 06:52.560
Because it's never been defeated,

06:52.650 --> 06:54.860
that's why monsters
keep getting drawn to it.

06:55.190 --> 06:57.530
And then, adventurers will rush over

06:57.610 --> 07:00.280
to take on quest after quest
until the boss is defeated.

07:00.700 --> 07:01.660
That's why

07:01.740 --> 07:04.320
the counter is always packed
during the day

07:04.410 --> 07:07.790
and I have to slog through
this overtime hell at night.

07:10.120 --> 07:11.710
There's no end to it.

07:12.210 --> 07:15.540
I see no hope at all.

07:16.000 --> 07:19.050
It's all that Dungeon Boss' fault.

07:19.260 --> 07:21.260
I've been enduring it for a month.

07:21.340 --> 07:23.300
I've been telling myself
once the Dungeon is cleared,

07:23.390 --> 07:25.050
I'll get back to my peaceful life again.

07:25.140 --> 07:28.180
So hang in there until then,
even with the daily overtime.

07:28.520 --> 07:31.270
But I'm already at my limit.

07:32.140 --> 07:34.860
Damn it.

07:34.940 --> 07:36.400
Overtime work

07:36.690 --> 07:37.860
can go to hell!

07:38.440 --> 07:39.400
I swear

07:39.780 --> 07:43.490
I'll clock out on time!

07:43.860 --> 07:46.990
(Belfra Underground Ruins)

07:52.290 --> 07:55.250
(Lowest floor)

08:01.170 --> 08:03.630
(Guardian of the Iron Wall)
Skill Activate, Guardian of the Iron Wall.

08:07.390 --> 08:08.850
Now, Guns!

08:18.860 --> 08:19.690
What?

08:19.780 --> 08:20.690
Lululi!

08:20.780 --> 08:22.190
(Healing Light)
Heal!

08:23.900 --> 08:24.910
Lowe!

08:24.990 --> 08:25.990
(Rain of Ice)
Rain of Ice!

08:37.460 --> 08:39.630
Damn it, even magic doesn't work on it.

08:39.710 --> 08:41.460
It's too strong.

08:41.960 --> 08:43.590
It's... it's impossible.

08:43.670 --> 08:45.470
I'm not strong enough...

08:46.180 --> 08:47.720
This is bad.

08:47.800 --> 08:49.100
Let's retreat for now.

08:53.270 --> 08:54.100
What?

08:54.350 --> 08:56.400
It's dangerous here. Run!

08:56.650 --> 08:58.060
Skill Activate!

09:01.530 --> 09:03.650
A skill that creates weapons?

09:03.740 --> 09:06.860
So it's you, you damn dragon!

09:06.950 --> 09:08.120
It's going to breathe fire!

09:08.200 --> 09:09.490
You're going to burn to a crisp!

09:10.330 --> 09:13.040
It's all because
you haven't been defeated.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.410
My overtime hell

09:14.500 --> 09:15.960
never ends!

09:16.040 --> 09:17.210
You bastard!

09:23.050 --> 09:24.380
I also…

09:29.600 --> 09:31.310
don't want

09:31.390 --> 09:33.680
to work overtime!

10:03.000 --> 10:03.960
You...

10:04.050 --> 10:06.800
piece of crap!

10:31.910 --> 10:33.410
No way.

10:33.910 --> 10:35.160
That outfit.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.620
Could it be the Executioner?

10:36.700 --> 10:38.210
The Executioner?

10:38.580 --> 10:40.540
A mysterious adventurer.

10:40.710 --> 10:43.170
If there's a dungeon
that stays undefeated,

10:43.250 --> 10:45.170
they'll solo the boss.

10:45.420 --> 10:47.010
Solo the boss?

10:47.090 --> 10:48.420
That's way too reckless.

10:48.760 --> 10:49.840
Yes.

10:49.930 --> 10:53.510
Normally, adventurers
would party up and fight.

10:53.600 --> 10:56.930
But the Executioner
can handle it on their own.

11:01.480 --> 11:04.570
Now, I should be able
to clock out on time tomorrow.

11:15.830 --> 11:18.160
I messed up again.

11:18.450 --> 11:20.250
"'Missing Person Request."

11:20.540 --> 11:23.460
"Since Guns of the Silver Sword
decided to retire,

11:23.540 --> 11:25.630
the Guild is looking
for the following person

11:25.710 --> 11:28.340
to be appointed as the new attacker."

11:29.050 --> 11:31.470
Am I an idiot?

11:31.970 --> 11:33.720
Ms. Alina!

11:34.180 --> 11:35.350
Lyra.

11:35.430 --> 11:38.310
Do you know who Lord Executioner is?

11:38.720 --> 11:39.930
No, not at all.

11:40.020 --> 11:42.440
By the way, why do you call him "lord"?

11:42.810 --> 11:45.860
Because he swooped in with style
to save people in a pinch

11:45.940 --> 11:48.030
and then left without a word.

11:48.110 --> 11:50.280
Lord Jade is popular too,

11:50.360 --> 11:54.280
but I think Lord Executioner
is way cooler than him!

11:54.530 --> 11:56.410
Is that so?

11:56.490 --> 11:58.790
If Lord Executioner joins
the Silver Sword,

11:58.870 --> 12:00.370
they'll be invincible, right?

12:01.460 --> 12:03.580
Can't we hurry up and find him?

12:03.920 --> 12:05.080
Are you kidding me?

12:05.170 --> 12:09.340
If they find out that I got a license
under a fake name and soloed bosses,

12:09.420 --> 12:10.670
I'll be fired right away.

12:10.760 --> 12:13.880
Besides, receptionists are civil servants,
so we can't have a side job.

12:14.510 --> 12:16.100
(Secure and Stable Life)
This job not only ensures a stable living,

12:16.180 --> 12:17.760
(Generous Benefits)
but also offers generous benefits.

12:17.850 --> 12:19.100
(Lifetime employment)
It even has a lifetime tenure.

12:19.180 --> 12:21.390
And I get to go home on time,

12:21.480 --> 12:23.810
as long as I don't have to work overtime.

12:24.390 --> 12:26.810
That's why I chose to be a receptionist.

12:26.900 --> 12:31.240
I can't let something like this
ruin my life as a receptionist!

12:31.650 --> 12:33.740
(Adventurer's Guild Headquarters)

12:33.820 --> 12:35.280
It's not her either.

12:35.660 --> 12:38.740
Her hair color
and eye color are different.

12:39.120 --> 12:41.540
Is it really a girl?

12:41.620 --> 12:43.160
I still can't believe it.

12:43.540 --> 12:46.170
She was wielding that huge weapon.

12:46.250 --> 12:47.460
There's no doubt about it.

12:47.540 --> 12:48.840
The Executioner

12:48.920 --> 12:51.170
is a young woman with black hair

12:51.260 --> 12:53.090
and green eyes.

12:53.340 --> 12:54.470
Leader,

12:54.550 --> 12:56.890
aren't you too obsessed
with the Executioner?

12:56.970 --> 12:58.720
Guns quit.

12:58.800 --> 13:01.470
Shouldn't we look
for a new attacker first?

13:02.600 --> 13:03.600
I'm sorry.

13:03.980 --> 13:05.980
Can you give me a little more time?

13:10.610 --> 13:12.820
No matter what, I will find her.

13:20.990 --> 13:23.080
Next, I want to buy some herbs.

13:23.290 --> 13:25.500
What? We're buying more?

13:25.790 --> 13:28.790
I want to go back
to my chambers and sleep.

13:36.010 --> 13:37.220
It's delicious.

13:38.430 --> 13:40.970
The grilled doughnuts here are so popular!

13:41.050 --> 13:42.850
Everyone who has tried them
raves about them!

13:47.390 --> 13:49.560
It's so delicious!

13:49.900 --> 13:51.520
After all, as adventurers,

13:51.610 --> 13:53.610
you never know
when something unexpected might happen.

13:53.690 --> 13:55.440
If there's something you want to do,
you'd better do it now.

13:55.530 --> 13:56.360
That's right.

13:56.450 --> 13:58.110
So stop napping in your room all the time.

13:58.200 --> 14:00.490
It's better to go outside more often.

14:00.570 --> 14:03.620
No, I may not look like it,
but I'm a very serious guy.

14:04.040 --> 14:07.040
I study my grimoire all night
almost every day.

14:07.120 --> 14:09.460
I guess I get more motivated at night.

14:09.540 --> 14:11.040
Anyway, this kind of life suits me.

14:11.130 --> 14:12.420
So…

14:19.010 --> 14:20.550
Well, this is all right.

14:32.230 --> 14:34.020
Jeez, those jerks.

14:34.110 --> 14:36.570
Everyone looks down on me.

14:36.650 --> 14:38.320
Just wait and see.

14:43.330 --> 14:45.580
Who are you?

14:47.910 --> 14:49.330
The so-called Relic

14:49.420 --> 14:52.170
is an artifact bearing the mark of Dia.

14:52.250 --> 14:54.500
It holds the skills of the Ancients

14:54.590 --> 14:56.880
and can bestow strength upon the user.

14:57.340 --> 15:00.130
That's why adventurers often fight for it.

15:00.220 --> 15:03.510
But the Executioner doesn't seem
interested in these things at all.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.720
That skill

15:05.810 --> 15:08.390
is different
from the Siglus Skills we have.

15:08.480 --> 15:09.940
It must be something else.

15:11.190 --> 15:12.600
Could it be a Dia Skill?

15:12.980 --> 15:15.070
No, it can't be.

15:15.440 --> 15:17.280
I'm definitely going to find you.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.530
I swear!

15:37.300 --> 15:38.380
That's…

15:38.460 --> 15:39.840
I'm sure of it.

15:40.010 --> 15:41.090
She has black hair

15:41.180 --> 15:42.890
and green eyes too.

15:48.930 --> 15:51.940
She's a Guild Receptionist?

15:54.310 --> 15:57.400
Only a handful of adventurers
are out looking for quests today too.

15:57.780 --> 16:00.240
A peaceful life like this is the best!

16:06.200 --> 16:07.200
Hey.

16:12.370 --> 16:14.750
Why is the leader
of the Silver Sword here?

16:14.830 --> 16:16.960
Is he here for the Executioner?

16:17.630 --> 16:20.050
How can I help you?

16:20.130 --> 16:22.420
I have a question.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.260
Did he find out?

16:24.340 --> 16:25.470
No, that's impossible.

16:25.550 --> 16:27.260
I covered my face.

16:27.350 --> 16:29.310
My adventurer's license
is also under a fake name.

16:29.560 --> 16:32.940
There shouldn't be any traces left behind.

16:33.190 --> 16:34.140
The other day,

16:34.230 --> 16:36.770
I met a powerful adventurer
who used a war hammer

16:36.860 --> 16:38.230
at the Belfra Underground Ruins.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.940
I've been looking
for that person since then.

16:40.030 --> 16:41.780
You know who that is, right?

16:43.070 --> 16:44.780
I'm very sorry.

16:44.860 --> 16:46.370
I have no idea.

16:46.740 --> 16:47.990
If you need anything,

16:48.080 --> 16:50.490
please ask another receptionist.

16:50.580 --> 16:51.580
You know what?

16:51.830 --> 16:53.870
My vision and sense of smell
are top-notch.

16:54.330 --> 16:56.630
I can see well even in dark places.

16:56.710 --> 16:59.040
That's why I saw her face.

16:59.460 --> 17:01.960
The adventurer who wielded a war hammer

17:02.050 --> 17:05.340
was a girl with black hair and green eyes,

17:05.800 --> 17:07.340
Ms. Alina Clover.

17:12.560 --> 17:15.270
He's driving me crazy!

17:15.390 --> 17:17.480
I even hid my face under my hood!

17:17.560 --> 17:19.770
It was so dark in the dungeon!

17:19.860 --> 17:21.440
He couldn’t have seen me!

17:21.820 --> 17:25.570
My, I didn't expect her
to be a receptionist.

17:27.870 --> 17:29.490
It's over.

17:29.580 --> 17:33.200
My life as a receptionist

17:33.290 --> 17:35.660
is over.

17:36.460 --> 17:37.290
No!

17:37.370 --> 17:39.210
This is a stable and safe job.

17:39.290 --> 17:42.250
I can't give up like this!

17:44.090 --> 17:45.380
Mr. Silver Sword,

17:45.670 --> 17:47.550
this isn't a good place to talk.

17:47.630 --> 17:49.090
Let's go somewhere else.

17:50.930 --> 17:51.760
Here.

17:51.850 --> 17:54.270
It's the loot from that day,
so please take it.

17:55.560 --> 17:56.810
Mr. Silver Sword,

17:56.890 --> 17:59.230
relics are said to be
far more durable and strong

17:59.310 --> 18:01.730
than other substances.

18:01.820 --> 18:02.690
That's right.

18:03.070 --> 18:05.150
That's why relics are so powerful...

18:09.700 --> 18:13.830
She... She crushed the relic
with her bare hands.

18:13.910 --> 18:18.250
I just want to live a peaceful life
as a receptionist.

18:18.330 --> 18:19.210
What?

18:19.920 --> 18:20.750
Ah, yes.

18:21.040 --> 18:23.590
That's why I won't let
anyone get in my way.

18:23.670 --> 18:25.460
If you don't want to get obliterated

18:25.550 --> 18:27.300
like that damn dragon,

18:27.380 --> 18:28.590
get lost!

18:28.680 --> 18:30.970
And don't ever show up
in front of me again!

18:32.010 --> 18:33.010
What?

18:33.470 --> 18:34.310
Goodbye.

18:34.390 --> 18:35.600
Wait!

18:35.850 --> 18:37.230
Guardian of the Iron Wall.

18:37.940 --> 18:38.850
This is a skill?

18:38.940 --> 18:39.980
That's right.

18:40.060 --> 18:42.360
It's a skill that hardens
anything I touch.

18:43.360 --> 18:44.820
I see.

18:45.070 --> 18:47.690
As the leader of the Silver Sword,

18:48.030 --> 18:51.570
I can't ignore the power
of the Executioner no matter what.

18:57.200 --> 18:59.330
What are you doing?

18:59.920 --> 19:04.500
I can't let my receptionist life
end like this.

19:04.920 --> 19:07.050
For the sake of my peaceful life,

19:08.050 --> 19:08.920
die!

19:09.010 --> 19:10.470
Wait, wait, wait!

19:10.550 --> 19:13.050
By the way,
where did that weapon come from?

19:13.140 --> 19:14.930
So, it's a Dia Skill after all?

19:15.220 --> 19:16.220
What's that?

19:16.310 --> 19:18.100
It's a type of phantom skill

19:18.180 --> 19:20.980
said to have disappeared
at the same time as the Ancients.

19:21.060 --> 19:24.190
Stronger than the highest-level
Siglus Skill used in modern times,

19:24.270 --> 19:26.440
- it's a legendary...
- Never mind that.

19:26.530 --> 19:27.740
Let's continue.

19:27.820 --> 19:29.030
Wait!

19:29.110 --> 19:31.280
I'm not here to fight you, Ms. Alina.

19:32.990 --> 19:36.540
I… I can't die here either.

19:36.620 --> 19:38.500
Oh, I see.

19:38.910 --> 19:40.120
I just

19:40.210 --> 19:42.080
want you, Ms. Alina.

19:43.920 --> 19:47.300
Watch out, I might sue you
for sexual harassment and power abuse.

19:49.470 --> 19:52.260
The sight of you fighting
the Hell-Flame Dragon.

19:52.590 --> 19:54.800
Ever since that day,
it hasn't left my mind.

19:54.890 --> 19:56.560
We, the Silver Sword,

19:56.640 --> 19:58.810
need you no matter what, Ms. Alina!

19:59.980 --> 20:01.020
Listen.

20:01.390 --> 20:05.270
I just want to live
a peaceful life as a receptionist.

20:05.360 --> 20:06.860
So please don't get in my way.

20:06.940 --> 20:07.780
Then,

20:07.860 --> 20:10.530
why did you want
to defeat the Hell-Flame Dragon?

20:11.650 --> 20:13.240
If you just want to be a receptionist,

20:13.320 --> 20:16.490
you don't have to solo those bosses.

20:18.290 --> 20:20.330
Because I hate working overtime.

20:20.750 --> 20:21.580
What?

20:21.660 --> 20:22.920
Because I think if I defeat it,

20:23.000 --> 20:25.130
I wouldn't have to work overtime.

20:25.210 --> 20:27.380
What? Overtime?

20:27.460 --> 20:29.250
What's with that face?

20:29.340 --> 20:31.630
Do I need another reason?

20:34.010 --> 20:35.300
Do you understand

20:35.390 --> 20:38.390
the despair of facing an endless mountain
of documents you can't seem to finish?

20:38.470 --> 20:41.140
Do you know that intense urge to kill

20:41.230 --> 20:43.810
when more work gets shoved onto you
while you're swamped?

20:44.270 --> 20:46.020
No, well...

20:46.110 --> 20:47.900
To cut down on overtime,

20:47.980 --> 20:50.190
I have to work overtime
to organize work documents.

20:50.280 --> 20:53.700
To cut down on overtime,
I have to work overtime to make manuals!

20:53.780 --> 20:55.700
Just to cut down on overtime!

20:55.780 --> 20:57.740
I don't understand. I'm sorry!

20:58.160 --> 20:59.370
In the first place,

20:59.450 --> 21:01.330
it's because you guys are always dawdling.

21:01.410 --> 21:03.830
That's why I have to work overtime.

21:03.910 --> 21:07.130
That's why I have
to put an end to this myself!

21:07.210 --> 21:10.000
I merely rely on my own strength
to get back to leaving work on time.

21:10.590 --> 21:12.420
What's wrong with that?

21:12.510 --> 21:15.880
Why is everyone trying
to find out who I am?

21:16.510 --> 21:17.760
I'm sorry.

21:19.010 --> 21:21.350
If you join Silver Sword,
you won't have to work overtime anymore.

21:21.430 --> 21:24.560
That's because you guys don't have
the concept of leaving on time!

21:25.020 --> 21:26.480
I'm sorry.

21:27.860 --> 21:28.810
Anyway,

21:28.900 --> 21:32.780
I have no intention
of joining the Silver Sword.

21:35.320 --> 21:36.320
Oh, right.

21:37.660 --> 21:39.240
If you dare mention this to anyone,

21:39.320 --> 21:40.910
I won't forgive you.

21:47.710 --> 21:50.170
I won't give up.

21:55.590 --> 21:56.840
For me,

21:56.930 --> 22:00.140
I'm content as long as I can spend
every day peacefully and happily.

22:00.510 --> 22:02.680
Yes, I can go home on time again today.

22:03.100 --> 22:06.600
Should I finally stop by
that cake shop on my way home?

22:08.600 --> 22:09.940
Give me the quest.

22:10.020 --> 22:11.400
The secret quest.

22:11.480 --> 22:13.900
I told you to give it to me!

22:16.570 --> 22:20.660
Looks like I'll have
to work overtime again.

23:52.830 --> 23:53.830
Next episode.

23:53.920 --> 23:56.550
I may be the Executioner,
but I'll use force

23:56.630 --> 23:58.840
to keep my identity a secret.

23:58.840 --> 24:00.840
(Next episode, I May Be the Executioner,
But I'll Use Force to Keep My Identity a Secret)
